# NISE COMPORT

> NISE COMPORT is an independent CSC / Pragya Kendra service centre in Kharangajhar, Telco Colony, Jamshedpur, Jharkhand. We help with PAN, Aadhaar guidance, Jharkhand certificates, voter services, banking (BC/AEPS), insurance, online forms, bill payments, printing and scanning.

- Address: Ground Floor, Singh Building, Shop No-3, Hanuman Mandir Road, Kharangajhar, Telco Colony, Jamshedpur, Jharkhand 831004
- Phone: +91 97712 19893, +91 98355 52756; landline 0657 291 7622
- Email: info@nisecomport.com
- Hours: Mon–Tue: 9:30 am – 2 pm; Wed: 9:30 am – 9 pm; Thu–Sat: 9:30 am – 2 pm; Sun: 10 am – 2 pm
- Languages: English, Hindi
- Status: independent CSC / Pragya Kendra service centre; not a government office. Official fees are separate from the service charge.

