- [Aadhaar PVC card: how to order the official card and track delivery](https://www.nisecomport.com/blog/aadhaar-pvc-card-order-guide): The official Aadhaar PVC card is printed and posted by UIDAI. Here’s how ordering works, what it costs and how to avoid unofficial printouts.
